{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0732_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0732_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b6ef578324fe83277bcfa2adb540ae338428fe0c8a105321ac0fbf5fe2f36d45", "ja": "お疲れ様、琴葉。\n……あれ？　なんだか今日はご機嫌だな。", "zh": "辛苦了，琴叶。  \n……咦？总觉得你今天心情特别好啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0732_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0732_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "3a86bce453cf658240a87d5a2f33effc2b5f78381e494830705cd3a40f8423a4", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。わかりますか？\n最近、お肌の調子がすごくいいんです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。您看得出来吗？\n最近我的皮肤状态特别好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0732_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0732_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0ef5f9e7d83fefce672e63c432abac85ce9c0ed0f747908fcf71c493ef835d3e", "ja": "へえ、何か特別なことでもしてるのか？", "zh": "哦，是做了什么特别的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0732_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0732_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "7ac8a446f74b5719fe5714cc25b7b911d103065f412903e360d19ff377335a29", "ja": "特に……あ、新しい入浴剤に変えたくらいです。\nそれがすごくしっとりとして、香りもよくて……。", "zh": "没什么特别的……啊，顶多就是换了新的沐浴剂。\n那款沐浴剂泡完后皮肤特别滋润，香味也很好闻……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0732_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0732_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "8ee73fec155d9ce7a43df0608427c29fc879aa324601a9630124dfe67173e394", "ja": "おかげで、お風呂の時間が楽しみになりました！\n長湯をしちゃうのは、反省ですけど……。", "zh": "托您的福，我开始期待泡澡时间了！\n不过不小心泡太久这点，还是得反省一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0732_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0732_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d4706d1ad712b4271594aac35f032050a57b7c0cef217ff253fc081ebb6fa62b", "ja": "ははっ、いいじゃないか。琴葉が気に入った入浴剤\n……どんな商品か気になってきたよ。", "zh": "哈哈，这不是挺好嘛。现在我也开始好奇琴叶喜欢的那款入浴剂……到底是什么产品了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0732_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0732_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "ca84f5561c8be17d64cb5dd0b37adc9cfab0f4121be18e84eaf11d76b52af621", "ja": "あ、それなら、商品名を……。", "zh": "啊，那样的话，我把商品名……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0732_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0732_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "537aefb50749294d91d9a7e184cdcb2ca62960c22868cb6fce9151de3d2d127f", "ja": "……あ。いえ、その、種類も多いので、\n今度のお休みとか……一緒に見に行きませんか？", "zh": "……啊。不是，我是说，种类也很多，所以……\n下次休息日之类的……要不要一起去看看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0732_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0732_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0e01cc26e7198010afee440ce6567a008e4c7c188e50bf2f5f33e568dfff5d06", "ja": "いいのか？　一人でいくのは心細くてね。\n詳しい人が居てくれると、心強いよ！", "zh": "这样好吗？我一个人去有点不安呢。\n有懂行的人陪着的话，就安心多了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0732_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0732_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "c5310f228b793a1c93d1251c9d6826440fd8bd420031b2882ab8fc6d25bd6ace", "ja": "もちろんです！　それじゃ、\n後で予定の相談を。……ふふっ♪", "zh": "当然可以啦！那么，\n稍后我们商量一下行程吧。……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
